&lt;b&gt;api.*&lt;/b&gt;: Cloudflare (rate limit, Turnstile, bot score) → Internet Gateway → Application Load Balancer.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3&lt;/b&gt;  ALB → Ingress &lt;i&gt;ticketstage-api&lt;/i&gt; → &lt;b&gt;api-gateway&lt;/b&gt;: xác thực JWT, kiểm tra token waiting room (bouncer).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;4&lt;/b&gt;  Giờ mở bán: &lt;b&gt;waiting-room-service&lt;/b&gt; xếp hàng FIFO trên Redis, cấp signed admission token (mỗi token tạo được 1 booking).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;5&lt;/b&gt;  api-gateway định tuyến /api/* tới auth, catalog, booking, checkin, notification; catalog giữ chỗ atomic chống oversell." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;spacing=2;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1690" width="1250" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t53" value="&lt;b&gt;6&lt;/b&gt;  Domain event qua outbox → Amazon MQ (RabbitMQ) → consumer: catalog, checkin, auth, notification (email, nhắc lịch).&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;7&lt;/b&gt;  Egress qua NAT Gateway: MongoDB Atlas (mỗi service một DB), VNPay / MoMo, Amazon SES.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;8&lt;/b&gt;  CI/CD: GitHub Actions test + quét + build arm64 → ECR; frontend → S3 + CloudFront; ghi tag vào ticket-infra → Argo CD sync vào EKS.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;9&lt;/b&gt;  Giám sát: Prometheus / Grafana / Tempo / OTel trong cluster; CloudWatch alarm → SNS gửi email." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;spacing=2;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1310" y="1690" width="1250" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lp54" value="" style="point;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1875" width="1" height="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lp55" value="" style="point;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="100" y="1875" width="1" height="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e56" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#232F3E;endArrow=open;endFill=0;startArrow=none;startFill=0;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#232F3E;" edge="1" parent="1" source="lp54" target="lp55"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t57" value="Luồng request đồng bộ" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;spacing=2;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="110" y="1866" width="300" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lp58" value="" style="point;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="420" y="1875" width="1" height="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lp59" value="" style="point;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="480" y="1875" width="1" height="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e60" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#ED7100;endArrow=open;endFill=0;startArrow=none;startFill=0;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#232F3E;" edge="1" parent="1" source="lp58" target="lp59"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t61" value="CI/CD &amp;amp; GitOps" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;spacing=2;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="490" y="1866" width="300" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lp62" value="" style="point;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="1875" width="1" height="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lp63" value="" style="point;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="860" y="1875" width="1" height="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e64" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;fontSize=10;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#E7157B;endArrow=open;endFill=0;startArrow=none;startFill=0;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#232F3E;" edge="1" parent="1" source="lp62" target="lp63"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t65" value="Sự kiện bất đồng bộ (RabbitMQ)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;spacing=2;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="870" y="1866" width="300" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t66" value="Nguồn: repo &lt;b&gt;ticket-infra&lt;/b&gt; (nhánh feature/cost-optimized-eks dựa trên dev) và &lt;b&gt;ticket-booking-app&lt;/b&gt;. Cấu hình node/DB khác nhau giữa dev, staging, prod; xem README mục 2." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;spacing=2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#545B64;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1200" y="1866" width="1360" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>